Enterprise-only sections

Import the shared badge in an MDX page and place it below the section heading:

```mdx
import { EnterpriseBadge } from "/components/EnterpriseBadge.tsx";

## Network access

<EnterpriseBadge />
```

The badge follows the app's Enterprise styling and switches with the docs theme.
Use it only where the feature requires Enterprise. State availability separately
for features that are not yet available.
